1
00:00:00,899 --> 00:00:02,899
(Sheldon:)You ask anyone, that's a hot date.

2
00:00:03,568 --> 00:00:07,158
(Amy:)Tempting choices, but I have
something special planned for tonight.

3
00:00:07,364 --> 00:00:10,494
(Sheldon:)What can be more special than having
an adequate amount of time...

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:14,620
(Sheldon:)...to cross the street on your way
to buy a tiny Lego lndiana Jones?

5
00:00:15,205 --> 00:00:17,625
(Amy:)With our friends moving forward
in relationships...

6
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:20,253
...l have decided
we should make progress in ours.

7
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:22,630
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear Lord.

8
00:00:22,838 --> 00:00:25,088
(Sheldon:)Two years ago,
we didn't even know each other...

9
00:00:25,298 --> 00:00:28,178
(Sheldon:)...and now I'm in your apartment
after dark.

10
00:00:29,428 --> 00:00:32,178
(Sheldon:)How much faster can this thing go?

11
00:00:32,848 --> 00:00:34,478
(Amy:)Had a feeling you'd be reluctant...

12
00:00:34,683 --> 00:00:37,723
(Amy:)...which is why I'm going to dip
into my bag of tricks.

13
00:00:37,936 --> 00:00:41,026
Oh, heh, you brain-monkeys kill me.
Dip away.

14
00:00:42,357 --> 00:00:45,857
l have devised an experiment that
l believe will increase your feelings...

15
00:00:46,069 --> 00:00:50,119
- ...for me in an accelerated time-frame.
- Well, how do you propose to do that?

16
00:00:50,323 --> 00:00:53,873
Uh, I hope you're not thinking about
some sort of LSD thought-control.

17
00:00:54,077 --> 00:00:57,077
(Sheldon:)There's only one mind-expanding drug
that this man enjoys.

18
00:00:57,289 --> 00:01:00,019
(Sheldon:)And that's called school.

